    <description>Automation inventory #5. When a Deliverable Update is created, sends the Project Manager a custom notification (bell + mobile) and an email. Runs on the asynchronous path so a notification or email failure never blocks the supplier&apos;s submission. Record-triggered flows run in system context without sharing, so it can read Project -&gt; Project Manager even when the submitter is a portal user who can&apos;t see the Project.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>Deliverable Update Notify PM {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Deliverable Update Notify PM</label>
